    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An Invisible, intangible trap appears on the ground at a point you choose within range. The first time a creature comes within 5 feet of it, the trap explodes in a burst of fire that fills a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on it, and the spell ends. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, it takes 8d6 Fire damage and, if it is Huge or smaller, is pushed 20 feet straight away from the trap.</p>",
